{"pin":"BH00548","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00548","anchor":"","first_line":"O Muhammad, upon thee be My glory! The letter of his honor H, upon him be My glory, which he had sent unto thee, hath been received in the presence of the Greater Branch [3.5s]... ...My God, my God! Praise be to Thee, inasmuch as Thou hast aided me to gaze upon the traces of Thy Most Exalted Pen....  In regard to what thou hast asked, the intent of the 'active force' [fa'il] is the lord of the species [rabb al-naw'], and it hath other meanings","first_line_orig":"یا محمد علیک بهائی نامه جناب ح علیه بهائی که بشما ارسال نموده غصن اکبر تلقاء  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"1360","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15718.337","source":"BLIB_Or15718","locator":"337"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM2#017 p.035x","source":"ADM2","locator":"017 p.035x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/558.pdf#page=35"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#19 p.34x","source":"ANDA","locator":"19 p.34x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/andalib-issue-19"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQA7#392 p.107","source":"AQA7","locator":"392 p.107","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/567.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK2.261.09x","source":"AVK2","locator":"261.09x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK2/ak2-262.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#695","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"695","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/997802300"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS1.014.1x","source":"MAS1","locator":"014.1x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS1/mas1-14.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NSS.103-104x","source":"NSS","locator":"103-104x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/nss.pdf#page=101"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#199n94x","source":"ADMS","locator":"199n94x","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/bh00151/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BLO_failyan","source":"BLO_failyan"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#122x","source